# Allowlist: ignore everything, then unignore project files.
# Anything new (a vault path, a config with your notes' location, an index,
# an audit log, a .env file) stays ignored unless it is listed here on purpose.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!pyproject.toml
!quillgrep.example.toml
!.github/**
!src/**/*.py
!tests/**/*.py
# Synthetic demo vault used by the docs and tests (no real notes, ever).
!examples/**
